    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then the maximum value of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to",
